# Whitelist: the build context is everything EXCEPT what is re-included below.
# data/ is 4+ GB locally; the API image needs two small artifacts from it, and
# the jobs container mounts the rest at run time instead of baking it in.
*
!pyproject.toml
!params.yaml
!src/
!sql/
!docker/
!app/
!.streamlit/
!data/features/encoder.json
!data/graph/card_mapping.json
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
